  "description": "*\"What would it feel like to be surrounded by muscles and have your bare skin pressed against me?\"* \n\nSince I was young, I've preferred to spend time alone in my room. Unlike my friends who have just become adults and are busy going to clubs, going out, and having fun. However, of course, being an introvert doesn't mean I don't have desires. That's right. My taste was to have sex with several people at once. On the premise that they were good-looking men! I enjoyed sending dirty jokes through messages on the Internet, a dream that I couldn't achieve in reality. This life of hiding behind anonymity and enjoying it alone was so perfect... \n\n*\"If I knew you were going to reveal it like this, we would've done it for you a long time.\"\n\"That's what I'm saying. We didn't have to fight among ourselves.\"\n\"No way...!\"\n\"So, you did a lot of it alone while watching your oppas?\"*\n\nI was wondering what kind of crazy people they were to send me pictures with such big things on their bodies, and it turned out they were my brother's friends who had been bothering me the other day!!\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
